00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.000
What type of trade that it is.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:44.000
So in 2019, we know that Zendesk booked a
gap loss and a non-gap profit.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:48.000
So it's a much more of a revenue growth
story.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:55.000
In 2019, the gap loss was at minus one
hundred and sixty nine point seven million
dollars.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:19:03.000
And a non-gap profit they booked as thirty
