00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:09.000
And the difference was due to a share
based compensation package or scheme.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:13.000
And it was related to expenses to do with
that.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:16.000
So we are operating here.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:21.000
Utilizing the non-gap profit numbers.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:26.000
Because we are working off a positive EPS
number.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:31.000
Now we're not going to go into all the
